window.docContents[37].resolve({"/Types/#Type-Systems--Types___-Type-Systems--Typed-Arithmetic-Expressions--Syntax":{"contents":"Here is the syntax of program terms, informally:\n\nt ::= \"true\"\n    | \"false\"\n    | \"if\" t \"then\" t \"else\" t\n    | \"0\"\n    | \"succ\" t\n    | \"pred\" t\n    | \"iszero\" t ;\n\n\nAnd here it is formally:\n\nnamespace TM\n\ninductive Tm where\n  | tru\n  | fls\n  | ite (c t e : Tm)\n  | zero\n  | succ (t : Tm)\n  | pred (t : Tm)\n  | isZero (t : Tm)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Type Systems\u0009Types: Type Systems\u0009Typed Arithmetic Expressions","header":"4.1.1. Syntax","id":"/Types/#Type-Systems--Types___-Type-Systems--Typed-Arithmetic-Expressions--Syntax"}});